Good evening, writers! This release is a relatively simple one, but it comes with a crucial quality-of-life improvement: **The app's hotkeys can now be customized.**

That is, key combinations to open a new note and to open the most-recently closed note. By default, these are Ctrl+N and Ctrl+Shift+T respectively. But there are now options to change them in the Settings menu!

As aside also, the app's buttons now visually react when actively pressed and held.
